    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Garbage-collection pause p99 / avg (ms) by generation. Needs distribution mapping, see README",
        "show_legend": true,
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "p99:switch.runtime.gc_pause{$service,$flint_env} by {generation}",
            "display_type": "line"
          },
          {
            "q": "avg:switch.runtime.gc_pause{$service,$flint_env} by {generation}",
            "display_type": "bars"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 9,
        "y": 38,
        "width": 3,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "**Things that are lost.** Each of these is a message or an event that existed and did not arrive. They are counted rather than only logged because every one of them is invisible from the outside: a send that never persisted looks like a quiet room, and an agent told it missed events has no way to tell anyone else.",
        "background_color": "gray",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "vertical_align": "top",
        "show_tick": false,
        "tick_pos": "50%",
        "tick_edge": "left",
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 41,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 2
