        "content": "**Decision routing.** With auto-route on, a person's untagged message waits while a decision backend picks which agent, if any, should answer it. Decisions and failures count requests to a backend; settled counts messages, however each one ended, and wait is how long the person waited for that. `backend` is the kind of backend asked, never which endpoint or workspace.\n\n**Waiting messages are server-wide.** Every pod reports the same pending count and oldest age, so they are read with max; a sum would multiply them by the number of pods. The health check exists only when the server has a default decision endpoint.",
